; FOTBuilder::IncludedContainerAreaNIC (FOTBuilder.h:377) — the one NIC record
; of this family that derives from BOTH DisplayNIC and InlineNIC. The display
; half travels in the shared DisplayNIC slot (the class is a display_foc), the
; two inline break priorities and the nine own fields live here.
; ★`scaleType` defaults to symbolMaxUniform, NOT symbolFalse — so an
; untouched included-container-area still prints scale="max-uniform", while a
; NUMERIC or PAIR scale sets the type to symbolFalse and prints scale-x/-y.
